{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That\u2019s My Tofu</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>VR cooking game</strong> where you gather around a bubbling hotpot, cook delicious ingredients, and race to serve them before your mischievous cousin snatches them away. Using chopsticks, you\u2019ll test your precision, speed, and reflexes as you juggle cooking, serving, and defending your food in a lively, chaotic feast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cook with chopsticks and skewers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick up, poke, and serve food using VR motion controls designed to feel like the real thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977020/extras/ce0102d5605670cdc0f3ba2008f243f1.poster.avif?t=1760498292\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977020/extras/ce0102d5605670cdc0f3ba2008f243f1.webm?t=1760498292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977020/extras/ce0102d5605670cdc0f3ba2008f243f1.mp4?t=1760498292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Defend your tofu</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fend off your sneaky AI cousin who tries to steal food right out of the pot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977020/extras/71af2229fa908da732006e479629ac18.poster.avif?t=1760498292\